│     └─0 text "=== \"pyproject.toml\""
├─17  code "```toml\n[tool.ruff.lint]\n# Add \"Q\" to the list of enabled codes.\nextend-select = [\"Q\"]\n\n[tool.ruff.lint.flake8-quotes]\ndocstring-quotes = \"double\"\n```"
│       lang: null
